      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锈蚀组那件事多谢你了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "950886807EC490A34EF64E8B591A8C224F604E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说当时的那只耿鬼，\n我最近都没见到它。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF45F5365F6768490A353EA803F9B3CFF0C000A621167008FD190FD6CA189C152305B833002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟是野生宝可梦嘛，\n就算它随着性子跑到别处也不奇怪。不过……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF662F91CE751F5B9D53EF68A6561BFF0C000A5C317B975B83968F774060275B508DD15230522B59044E5F4E0D5947602A30024E0D8FC720262026001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么说呢，常在眼前的家伙不见了，\n总觉得有点寂寞，或者说有点担心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E488BF45462FF0C5E385728773C524D76845BB64F194E0D89C14E86FF0C000A603B89C95F97670970B95BC25BDEFF0C621680058BF4670970B962C55FC33002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我想请你帮我一个怪怪的忙。\n如果你能帮我找到耿鬼，我会很高兴的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C621160F38BF74F605E2E62114E004E2A602A602A76845FD93002000A5982679C4F6080FD5E2E6211627E5230803F9B3CFF0C62114F1A5F889AD8517476843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要说谁最了解幽灵属性的宝可梦，\n那就是正义社的沐净啦！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我们一起去道场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818BF48C0167004E8689E35E7D70755C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A90A35C31662F6B634E49793E76846C9051C05566FF0100100001BE00000A62114EEC4E008D7753BB9053573A54273002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事情已理解。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B60C55DF2740689E3300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我有个条件。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46621167094E2A67614EF6300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和我对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C62115BF96218300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会赢的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A8D6276840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不太想",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D592A60F30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就继续束手无策下去吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C317EE77EED675F624B65E07B564E0B53BB5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是我的雪耻之战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F6211768496EA803B4E4B6218300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
