    },
    {
      "displayText": "这里？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD991CCFF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "灵！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7075FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "澄月廊街？\n好奇怪……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6F8467085ECA8857FF1F000A597D5947602A2026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼那家伙，\n说不定是爱上打扮了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3C90A35BB64F19FF0C000A8BF44E0D5B9A662F72314E0A6253626E4E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "并不是我爱去的那家叫晶火的店\n所在的幽影廊街。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E764E0D662F6211723153BB768490A35BB653EB6676706B76845E97000A6240572876845E7D5F715ECA8857300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我们就去澄月廊街吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362114EEC5C3153BB6F8467085ECA885754273002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我觉得这像是\n耿鬼也会来的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189C95F978FD950CF662F000A803F9B3C4E5F4F1A67657684573065B93002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶灯火灵，\n你知道什么了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C346676706F706B7075FF0C000A4F6077E590534EC04E484E865417FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "灵！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7075FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕哎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549554CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是它，\n我听叫声就知道了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F5B83FF0C000A6211542C53EB58F05C3177E590534E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼！\n你别跑太远啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3CFF01000A4F60522B8DD1592A8FDC554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回家咯。\n今晚是耿鬼你喜欢的炖菜哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE5BB654AF3002000A4ECA665A662F803F9B3C4F60559C6B227684709683DC54E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕哎哎。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549554CE54CE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了委托人，\n水晶灯火灵……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E8659D462584EBAFF0C000A6C346676706F706B70752026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好了，就这样吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D4E86FF0C5C318FD9683754273002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "连沐净和水晶灯火灵都找不到，\n我也可以甘心放弃了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDE6C9051C0548C6C346676706F706B707590FD627E4E0D5230FF0C000A62114E5F53EF4EE575185FC3653E5F034E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F2026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与其等它不见了才去找，\n不如当初先当了它的训练家，对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E51767B495B834E0D89C14E86624D53BB627EFF0C000A4E0D59825F53521D51485F534E865B8376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C5BF95427FF1F001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是，不经意间才注意到它在身边，\n这种程度的距离感其实才更好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662FFF0C4E0D7ECF610F95F4624D6CE8610F52305B8357288EAB8FB9FF0C000A8FD979CD7A0B5EA676848DDD79BB611F51765B9E624D66F4597D3002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这也是种缘分吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n谢谢你们尽心尽力地帮我找它！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E5F662F79CD7F1852065427300200100001BE01000A8C228C224F604EEC5C3D5FC35C3D529B57305E2E6211627E5B83FF01001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力所不及……\n抱歉……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529B62404E0D53CA20262026000A62B16B492026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼那家伙会在意打扮？\n如果真是那样，倒也挺有意思的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3C90A35BB64F194F1A5728610F6253626EFF1F000A5982679C771F662F90A36837FF0C50124E5F633A6709610F601D76843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿N",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n这家伙突然就回来了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8FD95BB64F197A8171365C3156DE67654E86FF01001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哽。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654FD30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说不定以后还会找不到它，\n那时候它也许不会回来了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但我会珍惜这家伙在这里的时光的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF44E0D5B9A4EE5540E8FD84F1A627E4E0D52305B83FF0C000A90A365F650195B834E5F8BB84E0D4F1A56DE67654E86300200100001BE01000A4F4662114F1A73CD60DC8FD95BB64F1957288FD991CC768465F6514976843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼回来的事\n我也告诉沐净了哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3C56DE676576844E8B000A62114E5F544A8BC96C9051C04E8654E63002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哽哽。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654FD54FD30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    }
